  comment   = {[Metadata-only record - full text paywalled and no abstract retrievable from open indexes.] Compares qualitative radiologist grading of lumbar spinal stenosis against quantitative machine-learning-supported texture analysis (texture features feeding a decision tree) within the LSOS study cohort. Valuable as a non-CNN, radiomics-style alternative attacking the same clinical problem.},
